t), and every returned pointer was successfully `free()`d — confirming allocator compatibility. Result: **ALL PASS**.\n4. `c_src/` is untouched (md5sums of all three files taken from the unmodified originals), and no stray build artifacts were left outside `translation/target/`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":733,"cache_read_input_tokens":22246,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":733,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e3bd2ea3-65a7-49ab-a28d-5528151089e7","uuid":"4584f00a-8180-4183-8d34-bc5dff0bd9b9","timestamp":"2026-08-27T17:47:22.378Z"}
